{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:02:37.310Z","ordinal":82670,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a114e8-3dc1-7553-b4e3-fbed0e137776","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5e07bff808191af67d9cd5997ca89","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Der größere Lauf hat einen weiteren Wartefehler beim IB-Player gezeigt. Währenddessen hatte ein paralleler Build die Frontend-Dateien verändert; deshalb ist dieser Lauf kein sauberer Build-Nachweis. Ich wiederhole ihn mit einem eingefrorenen Frontend und prüfe den IB-Player separat, bevor ich die Ursache einordne.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791352956139,"completed_at_ms":1791352957310}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:02:37.312Z","ordinal":82671,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5e07bff808191af67d9cd5997ca89","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Der größere Lauf hat einen weiteren Wartefehler beim IB-Player gezeigt. Währenddessen hatte ein paralleler Build die Frontend-Dateien verändert; deshalb ist dieser Lauf kein sauberer Build-Nachweis. Ich wiederhole ihn mit einem eingefrorenen Frontend und prüfe den IB-Player separat, bevor ich die Ursache einordne.\n"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a114e8-3dc1-7553-b4e3-fbed0e137776","create_time":1791352956.0125334,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5e07bff808191af67d9cd5997ca89","turn_id":"01a114e8-3dc1-7553-b4e3-fbed0e137776","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a114f4-e980-7022-ba19-df34cacc1619","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":307}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:02:49.543Z","ordinal":82672,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5e07d985c819192babc458a159917","status":"completed","call_id":"call_5b6c721b820b478abf0a72407198d891","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n test reproduces its CI timeout locally; the corrected real-browser monitor and\\n-shared flow through `participant-verona-loading` pass. The complete local and\\n-publication browser flows remain independent gates until they finish.\\n+shared flow through `participant-verona-loading` pass. The monitor and exact\\n+variant/run-selection browser checks also pass in headless CI mode. All 165 core,\\n+12 presence and 95 frontend tests, typecheck and a 469.82kB production build pass.\\n+The first larger local run subsequently times out waiting for the IB runtime;\\n+that run and another navigation timeout overlap a frontend rebuild. They are\\n+retained as failures, not a clean full-build acceptance or an asserted cause.\\n+The complete flow is being repeated against an immutable frontend; publication\\n+CI and PostgreSQL remain independent gates until they finish.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"selected_request_evidence=$(mktemp -d .data/selected-run-fault-boundaries-20261007.XXXXXX)\\ncp /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-ci-failures-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-monitor-published-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-monitor-chrome-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-monitor-ci-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-loading-chrome-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-loading-second-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-variant-ci-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-unit-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-typecheck-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-production-rebuild-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-full-memory-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-loading-ci-20261007.log /tmp/testcenter-source-delta-20261007.log \\\"$selected_request_evidence/\\\"\\nprintf '%s\\\\n' \\\"$selected_request_evidence\\\"\\ngit diff --check\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git add rewrite-app/scripts/participant-run-request-match.mjs rewrite-app/scripts/participant-run-request-match.test.mjs rewrite-app/scripts/smoke-ui.mjs rewrite-app/scripts/smoke-participant-monitor-live.mjs rewrite-app/package.json rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md && git diff --cached --stat && git commit -m 'Keep browser fault interception bound to the selected run'\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",max_output_tokens:1500,yield_time_ms:1000}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:90725,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:500}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"tail -4 /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-ib-isolated-20261007.log && rg 'ui_smoke_step=|Timeout|AssertionError' /tmp/testcenter-selected-request-full-frozen-ci-20261007.log | tail -6\",max_output_tokens:2000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a114e8-3dc1-7553-b4e3-fbed0e137776","create_time":1791352957.5976598}}}
